		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Giant, yellow-black beetle with an elephantine trunk and six beady black eyes.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 35, <strong>ATK</strong> 3 slam +6 (1d8 + rot), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> -2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +2, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Create Spawn</strong>. As an action, insert trunk into mortal corpse and detach it. Corpse swells and grows over 1d6 rounds before transforming into a behimiron.</p><p></p><p><strong>Great Evil</strong>. Only damaged by cold iron or magical sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Rot</strong>. CON 15+ or mortals take 1 STR and 1 DEX damage.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
